      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This may be related to another issue that was posted before at this link. https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/rotation-constraint-does-not-work-on-camera-and-mirror\n\nI'm choosing to make my own post for this rather than mention it in a comment since the constraint is at least partially working in this case, unlike how the rotation constraint was described in the linked post.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
